{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Daily Organizer 是一款結合待辦清單、習慣追蹤與筆記的每日規劃工具，適合工作排程繁重、需要統整個人事務與專案進度的使用者。它提供智能提醒、重複任務與目標記錄功能，讓日常安排更有條理。原價 US $17.99 的終生版內購目前限時免費，用戶可趁機收下完整功能。</p>\n\n<h2>待辦自動順延與智能提醒</h2>\n<p>Daily Organizer 以直觀介面讓用戶快速新增、編輯與排序任務，未完成的項目會自動順延至翌日，清單不會堆積。重複任務與習慣可按日、週或月循環設定，方便建立穩定作息。內置筆記、清單與目標專區，購物清單及長期計劃可集中管理，配合智能通知，重要事項不易遺漏。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-247-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-248-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-249-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-250-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-251-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-252-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Daily Organizer: Easy Planner 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後進入 Settings，選 Unlock all feature，看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<img alt=\"IMG 5894\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/IMG_5894-473x1024.webp\"/>\n<img alt=\"IMG 5895\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/IMG_5895-473x1024.webp\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Daily Organizer: Easy Planner</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:04.269466+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":502,"images":8,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T22:44:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:13.467727+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:13.467727+00:00","content_hash":"3a32d8a65dabef087e3c47c737711a2f3c1aad745718758d9fc584d005faeaa0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}